}}'''Pumpkin''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2019 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2019|2019 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is gray with 6 pumpkins and dark green vines all over it, resembling a pumpkin patch, hence the name. The guard and handle are dark green with a vine texture. 

== Trivia ==

* For unknown reasons its name was changed from "Pumpkin Patch" to "Pumpkin" during October 2025.

